<para>Clear the registered instance. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Intended for <bold>test isolation only</bold>. After <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_registry_1a3e1a423464c39da80ad6a5ebe9b898ec" kindref="member">reset()</ref></computeroutput> any call to <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_registry_1a63324a8845db86eb485ef20c2ea0cb9f" kindref="member">instance()</ref></computeroutput> will throw <computeroutput>std::logic_error</computeroutput> until <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_registry_1ac351bdd30bd3869f83420897d748733d" kindref="member">initialize()</ref></computeroutput> is called again.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="warning"><para>Not safe to call while any thread is executing a toolbox operation. Always call from a single-threaded context (e.g. <computeroutput>TearDownTestSuite()</computeroutput>). </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
