    <briefdescription>
<para>Process-global registry for the shared <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_ingestion_toolbox" kindref="compound">IngestionToolbox</ref></computeroutput> instance. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<sect1 id="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_registry_1autotoc_md13_1s1"><sect2 id="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_registry_1autotoc_md13">
<title>Lifecycle</title><para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>Bootstrap</bold> (server <computeroutput>main()</computeroutput> or test <computeroutput>SetUpTestSuite()</computeroutput>): <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_registry_1ac351bdd30bd3869f83420897d748733d" kindref="member">ToolboxRegistry::initialize</ref>(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>ToolboxBuilder()</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.withTextBackend(llm)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.build());</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Use</bold> (anywhere, any thread): <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>t<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_registry_1a63324a8845db86eb485ef20c2ea0cb9f" kindref="member">ToolboxRegistry::instance</ref>();<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>shared_ptr&lt;IngestionToolbox&gt;</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Teardown</bold> (test suites or graceful shutdown): <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_registry_1a3e1a423464c39da80ad6a5ebe9b898ec" kindref="member">ToolboxRegistry::reset</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
<sect1 id="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_registry_1autotoc_md14_1s1"><sect2 id="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_registry_1autotoc_md14">
<title>Design notes</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>No lazy construction. <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_registry_1a63324a8845db86eb485ef20c2ea0cb9f" kindref="member">instance()</ref></computeroutput> throws <computeroutput>std::logic_error</computeroutput> if the registry has not been initialised. This prevents subtle &quot;first-call
  initialises with defaults&quot; bugs.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_toolbox_registry_1a3e1a423464c39da80ad6a5ebe9b898ec" kindref="member">reset()</ref></computeroutput> exists exclusively for test isolation. Do not call it in production code.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>The underlying <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_ingestion_toolbox" kindref="compound">IngestionToolbox</ref></computeroutput> remains fully accessible via the injected pattern; registering a global instance is opt-in. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
